  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Your day has opinions. Our Selene shoulder bag handles them. It's crafted in durable pebbled leather with a zip closure that keeps your things secure, and it moves from a full calendar to wherever the evening takes you. (Still going when you are.)</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (moon dust, southwest desert); silver hardware (smokyamethyst, light rosebud, pomegranate, hot fudge, black)</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable and removable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop at center hole</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.2&quot; (L) x 7.8&quot; (H) x 2.4&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
